msgstr "Yi amfani da Threads x"

#: setup.php
msgid "How many background threads do you wish Cacti to use when exporting graphs.  Default is 0 to run all export in poller thread, 1 or more to spawn separate background threads"
msgstr "Zaren aiki na baya nawa kake son Cacti ya yi amfani da su yayin fitar da jadawalai.  Na asali shi ne 0 don gudanar da dukkan fitarwa a cikin zaren mai tattara bayanai, 1 ko fiye don ƙirƙirar zaren aiki na baya daban-daban"

