#: setup.php
msgid "Check this if you want to delete any existing files in the FTP remote directory. This option is in use only when using the PHP built-in ftp functions."
msgstr "Yi alama a nan idan kana son share duk wasu fayiloli da ke cikin kundin FTP mai nisa. Ana amfani da wannan zaɓin ne kawai lokacin da ake amfani da ayyukan ftp na PHP na asali."

#: setup.php
msgid "Remote Host"
